{"id":"gitter","lemma":"Gitter","pos":"noun","rank":3802,"glosses":["lattice, grid, mesh (of metal), grating, bars","lattice","bars (i.e. prison)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɪtɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/11/De-Gitter.ogg/De-Gitter.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gitters","plural":"Gitter"},"examples":[{"text":"Er wurde hinter Gitter gebracht.","en":"He was thrown behind bars.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"behind, after"},null,{"g":"brought, carried"}]},{"text":"Dafür könnte ich dich hinter Gitter bringen.","en":"I could get you arrested for that.","words":[{"g":"for that, for it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"behind, after"},null,{"g":"to bring"}]},{"text":"Tom gehört hinter Gitter.","en":"Tom belongs behind bars.","words":[null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"behind, after"},null]},{"text":"Die Polizei bringt dich für zwanzig Jahre hinter Gitter.","en":"The police will put you behind bars for twenty years.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"behind, after"},null]},{"text":"Die Polizei bringt Sie für zwanzig Jahre hinter Gitter.","en":"The police will put you behind bars for twenty years.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"behind, after"},null]}]}